ncies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nConsistently reproducible in Godot 4.6.stable.\nNot reproducible in Godot 4.5.stable.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9174) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12490F (12 threads) - 15.81 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\n> Translated by Microsoft Translator\n\n## The Problem\nI can't rename the scene instance; the 'Rename' button has disappeared.\nWhether in the Classic theme or the Modern theme, 'Rename' has disappeared.\n\n## Some Photos\n\n### 4.6 - Modern\nNormal node\n<img width=\"467\" height=\"661\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/caa4fedd-8531-4377-9b9a-01559d8936ad\" />\n\nScenario Instance Node\n<img width=\"444\" height=\"901\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/865dc55b-1f60-492c-8ae5-2d41154faa1e\" />\n\n### 4.6 - Classic\nNormal node\n<img width=\"477\" height=\"817\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7f1325f8-0151-4dc8-9df1-100b1185e013\" />\n\nScenario Instance Node\n<img width=\"420\" height=\"770\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4cdc0d82-e6ef-4cb6-9286-3603d7151fdb\" />\n\n**It can be seen that the scene instance node is missing the 'Rename' button (which is '重命名' in Chinese).**\n\n## In Godot 4.5.stable\nNormal Node\n<img width=\"409\" height=\"713\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5264b855-c351-4cf7-854c-8709ebfead3a\" />\n\nScenario Instance Node\n<img width=\"480\" height=\"905\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c39fdf42-f00d-4a04-82d7-f26f71a24111\" />\n\n**Everything is normal.**\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n**1. Create a scene and save it.\n2. Instantiate this scene into another scene.\n3. Try right-clicking this scene instance node**\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7b9fc7d5-33c6-4376-bb60-353bd48216c0\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI'll just upload the project from the video directly. The two scenes inside it are completely empty. I also haven't changed any project settings.\n\n[test_project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24934840/test_project.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115572/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115572/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}